      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天赋异禀的全能少女，\n决定参战“天皇赏（秋）”。\n这个话题很快便传遍了特雷森学园。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbe3524546236269bfce73e52f54d28c5d3e647aea6cc8e39eed2959458adcbf",
